A tiny addition:

Instead of writing
x1|z1 ~ N(z1, v)
z1 ~ N(t1, w)
in a nested structure

We can just write
x1 = z1 + e1
with e1 ~ N(0, v)

...and so we turn all nested structures into simple sums instead (recursively).

Haakon

