> > > > Technician, Sample.
> > > >
> > > > He creates a two levels of labels in R
> > > >
> > > > eggs$labtech <- factor(paste0(eggs$Lab,eggs$Technician))
> > > > eggs$labtechsamp <-
> > > > factor(paste0(eggs$Lab,eggs$Technician,eggs$Sample))
> > > >
> > > > Then, his model includes the RE as "layers" including groups and sub-
> > > > groups:
> > > >
> > > > formula <- Fat ~ 1 + f(Lab, model="iid") + f(labtech, model="iid") +
> > > > f(labtechsamp, model="iid")
> > > >
> > > > This is where I'm confused.  The combined label of "labtechsamp" is
