Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

For a small number of derived, and linear, effects, the lincomb feature can be used, but a more general approach is to use inla.posterior.sample to generate joint samples, from which any functionals can be computed, similarly to quantities derived from NUgS samples.

Finn

